{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation complete in worktree ../deps-bump. Bumped pypandoc-binary 1.15->1.17 (wiki+dev) and ruff 0.16.1->0.16.2 (dev); mcp stays >=1.28.1,<2 / 1.29.0 — the 2.0 half of PR #127 remains deferred to epic 732b-51df-acf2-477b (bared-nickel-insect), consistent with PRs #124/#125. pypandoc-binary 1.17 bundles pandoc 3.9 (was 3.6.1): updated NOTICE, notice-test version string (upstream-URL assertion line untouched — owned by a parallel change), test_wiki_render.py provenance asserts (pypandoc 1.17 / banner 'pandoc 3.9'), ADR 0095 Pin provenance, ADR 0096 fingerprints, wiki_render.py docstring, tests/scripts generator-test literals (6). Byte-safety baseline re-established: LEGACY_PANDOC_VERSION=3.9; darwin-arm64 sha256 d7b1e75cd20ee6a788a1399492be07d4559949e18e55f34cfc5c91807fdfa90d (installed binary); linux-x86_64 sha256 decd3dd11a3fe0c16ce56443343ec53adde6fbed6f97d7f56f06b1c424248e7b (extracted from the uv.lock-pinned manylinux wheel, wheel sha verified against uv.lock). Regenerated legacy manifest + 3 replay fixtures via the generator; diffs are provenance-only — pandoc 3.9's jira writer emits byte-identical output for all 884 units (smoke-verified shapes first: h1. {anchor:}, {{mono}}, arrow escaping, HTML-comment deletion all unchanged). Gates: generator --check PASS; targeted modules (notice/wiki_render/hardening/generator tests) 83/83 PASS; make lint (ruff 0.16.2, no new findings) PASS; make typecheck PASS; uv lock --check PASS. Full pytest tests/unit tests/scripts: 11516 passed, 43 failed + 13 errors — ALL pre-existing host-environment failures (git 'fatal: not in a git directory' on bare-repo config in test fixtures), reproduced identically on the untouched main checkout at origin/main 0f34e8dc3b; none touch pandoc/wiki/ruff surfaces. Proceeding to commit + push to Gerrit."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786809905366065001,"uuid":"13492e2b-abf9-4455-868b-34cfcf5bc4e0"}